        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3001 - Muhammad ibn Muslim narrated from Abu Abdullah (as) that he said:\n\"For one who is fearful, there is no harm in stoning the Jamarat at night, slaughtering the sacrifice at night, and performing the Tawaf of Ifadah at night.\""
